{"seq":1,"slug":"unit-price-per-kg-l-oz","title":"每单位/每升/每百克价折算与展示","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/unit-measure-packsize-conversion/uom-pricing-inventory/unit-price-per-kg-l-oz","wordCount":2033,"readingTime":9,"html":"<h1 id=\"每单位-每升-每百克价折算与展示\">每单位/每升/每百克价折算与展示</h1><p>超市货架上的小标签除了总价，还有一行小字：&quot;$0.29/oz&quot;。这一行不是营销信息，在很多市场它是<strong>法定展示项</strong>，目的是让消费者能跨规格比较——同一种麦片，700 克装和 1 磅装哪个更划算，只有单位价格能回答。对跨境系统来说，这行小字的麻烦在于：它的分母是<strong>法定基准单位</strong>、它的值时点是<strong>当时的售价</strong>、它的取整方式必须<strong>固定</strong>，三个条件任一不满足都会带来合规风险或客诉。</p>\n<p>这一篇处理价格在单位之间的折算。核心问题是三个：单价该以什么身份存在、折算在哪里发生、算出来的数怎么保证与总价自洽。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>单价的折算是一个<strong>归一化</strong>问题：把任意单位上的价格映射到基本单位上的价格，所有后续计算都在归一化空间里进行，最后再投影回目标单位。归一化空间的存在，是&quot;任意单位组合只有一条计算路径&quot;这一性质的来源——没有它，每增加一种单位组合就多一条代码路径，而多条路径必然取整不一致。</p>\n<p>与之配套的是<strong>取整的时点</strong>：归一化过程全程保持全精度，只在输出金额与输出单位价格时取整。因此系统里必须明确区分&quot;计算量&quot;（全精度）与&quot;呈现量&quot;（已取整），并且禁止把呈现量回写成计算量——这是这一层最常见的一类缺陷。</p>\n<h2 id=\"单价的三种身份\">单价的三种身份</h2><h3 id=\"挂牌价-单位价-结算价\">挂牌价、单位价、结算价</h3><p>同一个商品在系统里至少有三种与价格相关的量。<strong>挂牌价</strong>是商家为该销售单位设定的价格（&quot;每磅 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>3.99</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&quot;</mi><mtext>）；</mtext><mo>∗</mo><mo>∗</mo><mtext>单位价</mtext><mo>∗</mo><mo>∗</mo><mtext>是派生的合规展示值（</mtext><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&quot;</mi><mtext>每千克</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">3.99&quot;）；**单位价**是派生的合规展示值（&quot;每千克</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">3.99&quot;</span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">）；</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">∗</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">∗</span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">单位价</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">∗</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">∗</span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">是派生的合规展示值（</span><span class=\"mord\">&quot;</span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">每千克</span></span></span></span></span>8.80&quot;）；<strong>结算价</strong>是订单行金额除以数量得到的实际单价。</p>\n<p>三者的权威关系是单向的：挂牌价是源，单位价与结算价都是派生。任何反向写回（用单位价覆盖挂牌价）都会造成精度损失——<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>8.80</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi>k</mi><mi>g</mi><mtext>反算回每磅会得到</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">8.80/kg 反算回每磅会得到</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">8.80/</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">反算回每磅会得到</span></span></span></span></span>3.9918…，与最初的 $3.99 不等。</p>\n<h3 id=\"为什么不能把单位价存为主数据\">为什么不能把单位价存为主数据</h3><p>存下来看似的便利在于查询快，但代价是三处：投放新市场时单位价的分母变了（欧盟要每千克、美国习惯每磅），存量数据要全量重算；促销改价时若只改了挂牌价忘了单位价，页面上会出现两个矛盾的数字；以及历史订单引用的单位价必须冻结，而商品主数据里的单位价是活的。结论是：<strong>单位价按需计算并缓存，缓存键包含商品版本与市场规则版本</strong>。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>价格类型</th>\n<th>权威来源</th>\n<th>变更触发</th>\n<th>可否被覆盖</th>\n<th>落库</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>挂牌价</td>\n<td>定价策略</td>\n<td>调价/促销</td>\n<td>是（由定价侧）</td>\n<td>是，主数据</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>单位价</td>\n<td>挂牌价 + 市场规则</td>\n<td>任一变化</td>\n<td>否</td>\n<td>否（缓存）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>结算价</td>\n<td>订单行金额 / 数量</td>\n<td>下单时冻结</td>\n<td>否</td>\n<td>是，订单快照</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"折算的两种方向\">折算的两种方向</h2><h3 id=\"从单价推总价-还是从总价推单价\">从单价推总价，还是从总价推单价</h3><p>客户下单 0.454 千克，挂牌价是&quot;每磅 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>3.99</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&quot;</mi><mtext>。两种算法：先把</mtext><mn>0.454</mn><mi>k</mi><mi>g</mi><mtext>换算成磅（</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">3.99&quot;。两种算法：先把 0.454 kg 换算成磅（</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">3.99&quot;</span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">。两种算法：先把</span><span class=\"mord\">0.454</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">换算成磅（</span></span></span></span></span>\\approx 1.0009<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>l</mi><mi>b</mi><mtext>）再乘单价，得到</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">lb）再乘单价，得到</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">b</span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">）再乘单价，得到</span></span></span></span></span>3.9936<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>；或者先算出</mtext><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&quot;</mi><mtext>每千克价</mtext><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&quot;</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">；或者先算出&quot;每千克价&quot;</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">；或者先算出</span><span class=\"mord\">&quot;</span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">每千克价</span><span class=\"mord\">&quot;</span></span></span></span></span>8.7955<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>再乘</mtext><mn>0.454</mn><mtext>，得到</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">再乘 0.454，得到</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">再乘</span><span class=\"mord\">0.454</span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">，得到</span></span></span></span></span>3.9931$。两者相差不到一分，但<strong>如果订单量大或反复折算，差异会累积</strong>。</p>\n<p>正确的口径是：<strong>以基本单位为准</strong>，先把挂牌价归一化到&quot;每基本单位价&quot;，再用基本单位数量相乘。这样任意单位组合都只有一条计算路径，可逆性由构造保证。</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>P</mi><mtext>line</mtext></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>q</mi><mtext>base</mtext></msub><mo>×</mo><mfrac><msub><mi>P</mi><mtext>list</mtext></msub><msub><mi>q</mi><mtext>list_base</mtext></msub></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P_{\\text{line}} = q_{\\text{base}} \\times \\frac{P_{\\text{list}}}{q_{\\text{list\\_base}}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">line</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7778em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">base</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.4133em;vertical-align:-1.053em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3603em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">list_base</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.367em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">list</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.053em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>q</mi><mtext>list_base</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">q_{\\text{list\\_base}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7976em;vertical-align:-0.367em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">list_base</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.367em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是该挂牌单位对应的基本单位数量（每磅 = 453.59237 克）。</p>\n<h3 id=\"取整只在末端\">取整只在末端</h3><p>中间过程（归一化单价）保留全精度，只在<strong>输出线金额</strong>时按货币精度取整。这与 <a href=\"../uom-masterdata/metric-imperial-conversion-factor\">公制/英制换算因子与精度</a> 确立的&quot;取整只在换算链末端一次&quot;一致。货币取整用 half-up，数量取整用 half-even，两者在这里第一次同框出现，因此必须在同一个函数里显式区分。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;  A[挂牌价 P_list / 挂牌单位 u_list] --&gt; B[归一化单价&lt;br/&gt;P_base = P_list / q_list_base]&#10;  B --&gt; C[线基本数量 q_base]&#10;  C --&gt; D[线金额 raw = P_base x q_base]&#10;  D --&gt; E{取整到货币精度&lt;br/&gt;HALF_UP}&#10;  E --&gt; F[线金额 P_line]&#10;  F --&gt; G[单位价 = P_base 换算到&lt;br/&gt;法定基准单位后 HALF_UP]&#10;  B --&gt; G&#10;  G --&gt; H[展示: 每千克/每升/每百克价]&#10;  F --&gt; I{与按挂牌单位直接算是否一致?}&#10;  I --&gt;|差异 &gt; 容差| J[告警并对账]\">graph TD\n  A[挂牌价 P_list / 挂牌单位 u_list] --&gt; B[归一化单价&lt;br/&gt;P_base = P_list / q_list_base]\n  B --&gt; C[线基本数量 q_base]\n  C --&gt; D[线金额 raw = P_base x q_base]\n  D --&gt; E{取整到货币精度&lt;br/&gt;HALF_UP}\n  E --&gt; F[线金额 P_line]\n  F --&gt; G[单位价 = P_base 换算到&lt;br/&gt;法定基准单位后 HALF_UP]\n  B --&gt; G\n  G --&gt; H[展示: 每千克/每升/每百克价]\n  F --&gt; I{与按挂牌单位直接算是否一致?}\n  I --&gt;|差异 &gt; 容差| J[告警并对账]</pre><p><code>I</code> 这一步是自洽性检查：同一笔订单，用挂牌单位直接算和用基本单位归一化算，结果之差不应超过一分。超过就说明某处用了两套因子。</p>\n<h2 id=\"单位价格展示的规则\">单位价格展示的规则</h2><h3 id=\"分母由法规决定\">分母由法规决定</h3><p>欧盟的消费者价格标示制度确立了销售价与单位价格并列标示的框架，成员国在其中具体规定适用的商品范围与基准单位。美国方面，NIST Handbook 130 收录的《统一单位定价规范》（Section IV.C）是各州立法的示范模板，同手册的 Section IV.A 与 IV.B 分别覆盖净含量声明与商品销售方式（<a href=\"https://www.nist.gov/pml/owm/nist-handbook-130-current-edition\">NIST Handbook 130</a>）。两套体系的共同前提是：单位价格的可比性依赖于<strong>一个统一的计量基础</strong>，而这正是 SI 及其在各国的法定化所提供的（<a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/International_System_of_Units\">SI 基本单位</a>）。</p>\n<p>两套体系的共同点是：<strong>基准单位是千克或升这一级的量级，且对特定品类有例外</strong>。工程上的含义是分母不能在页面上写死，必须取自 <a href=\"../uom-masterdata/legal-unit-market-label\">各市场法定计量单位</a> 里的市场规则。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>品类</th>\n<th>常见基准</th>\n<th>依据来源</th>\n<th>例外</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>食品干货</td>\n<td>每千克 或 每 100 克</td>\n<td>市场计量法规</td>\n<td>小包装可放宽</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>饮料</td>\n<td>每升 或 每 100 毫升</td>\n<td>市场计量法规</td>\n<td>酒类常按每升</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>日化</td>\n<td>每升 或 每千克</td>\n<td>市场计量法规</td>\n<td>纸品可能按每张</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>纺织</td>\n<td>每米 或 每平方米</td>\n<td>市场计量法规</td>\n<td>有时按每件</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"小数位数与可见性\">小数位数与可见性</h3><p>单位价的小数位数通常比单价多一位（单价 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>3.99</mn><mtext>、单位价</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">3.99、单位价</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">3.99</span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">、单位价</span></span></span></span></span>8.80），因为基准单位的量级更大。位数由市场规则规定，不由前端决定。同时在页面上，单位价格的<strong>可见性</strong>（是否折叠、字号）也受&quot;不得弱化&quot;的约束——把合规信息藏在折叠区可能被认定为未充分披露。</p>\n<h2 id=\"实现要点\">实现要点</h2><h3 id=\"缓存键与失效\">缓存键与失效</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"json\" data-code=\"{&#10;  &quot;unit_price_cache&quot;: {&#10;    &quot;key&quot;: [&quot;sku_id&quot;, &quot;market_code&quot;, &quot;currency&quot;, &quot;list_price_version&quot;, &quot;market_rule_version&quot;],&#10;    &quot;value&quot;: { &quot;basis_uom&quot;: &quot;KGM&quot;, &quot;amount&quot;: &quot;8.80&quot;, &quot;minor_unit_digits&quot;: 2 },&#10;    &quot;ttl_seconds&quot;: 3600,&#10;    &quot;invalidate_on&quot;: [&quot;list_price_change&quot;, &quot;market_rule_change&quot;, &quot;fx_change&quot;]&#10;  }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"unit_price_cache\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"key\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"sku_id\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"market_code\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"currency\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"list_price_version\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"market_rule_version\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"value\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"basis_uom\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"KGM\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"amount\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"8.80\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"minor_unit_digits\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">2</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"ttl_seconds\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">3600</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"invalidate_on\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"list_price_change\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"market_rule_change\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"fx_change\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>把 <code>market_rule_version</code> 放进缓存键是本篇最容易被漏掉的一处：市场规则变了（比如某品类基准从每 100 克改成每千克），若缓存键不含规则版本，页面会继续显示旧分母下的数字。</p>\n<h3 id=\"一致性对账\">一致性对账</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"WITH line AS (&#10;  SELECT o.order_id, o.sku_id, o.qty_sales, o.qty_sales_uom,&#10;         o.unit_list_price, o.line_amount, o.currency&#10;  FROM order_line o&#10;  WHERE o.created_at &gt;= now() - interval &#39;1 day&#39;&#10;),&#10;norm AS (&#10;  SELECT l.*,&#10;         b.factor_to_base AS f_sales,&#10;         bl.factor_to_base AS f_list,&#10;         ROUND(l.unit_list_price / bl.factor_to_base, 18) AS price_per_base&#10;  FROM line l&#10;  JOIN uom b  ON b.uom_code  = l.qty_sales_uom&#10;  JOIN uom bl ON bl.uom_code = l.unit_list_uom&#10;)&#10;SELECT order_id, sku_id, currency,&#10;       line_amount,&#10;       ROUND(price_per_base * qty_sales * f_sales, 2) AS recomputed_amount,&#10;       ROUND(line_amount - ROUND(price_per_base * qty_sales * f_sales, 2), 2)&#10;         AS delta&#10;FROM norm&#10;WHERE ABS(line_amount - ROUND(price_per_base * qty_sales * f_sales, 2)) &gt; 0.01;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">WITH</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> line</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  SELECT</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> o</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">order_id</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">o</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">sku_id</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">o</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">qty_sales</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">o</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">qty_sales_uom</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">         o</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">unit_list_price</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">o</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">line_amount</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">o</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">currency</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> order_line o</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> o</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">created_at</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> >=</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> now</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">() </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> interval </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'1 day'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">norm </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  SELECT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> l.</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">         b</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">factor_to_base</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> f_sales,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">         bl</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">factor_to_base</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> f_list,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">         ROUND</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">l</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">unit_list_price</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> /</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> bl</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">factor_to_base</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">18</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> price_per_base</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  FROM</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> line</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> l</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  JOIN</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> uom b  </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">ON</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> b</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">uom_code</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  =</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> l</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">qty_sales_uom</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  JOIN</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> uom bl </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">ON</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> bl</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">uom_code</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> l</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">unit_list_uom</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">SELECT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> order_id, sku_id, currency,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">       line_amount,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">       ROUND</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(price_per_base </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> qty_sales </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> f_sales, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">2</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> recomputed_amount,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">       ROUND</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(line_amount </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> ROUND</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(price_per_base </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> qty_sales </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> f_sales, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">2</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">), </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">2</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">         AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> delta</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> norm</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> ABS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(line_amount </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> ROUND</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(price_per_base </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> qty_sales </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> f_sales, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">2</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">></span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">01</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span></code></pre></div><p>这条查询每天找出<strong>归一化重算与订单实际金额不符</strong>的行。它是发现&quot;某处偷偷用了另一套因子&quot;的最直接手段，也是 <a href=\"../uom-customs-rounding/uom-consistency-validation\">订单/库存/发票单位一致性校验</a> 在价格维度的前置检查。</p>\n<h2 id=\"与可变重量商品的交界\">与可变重量商品的交界</h2><p>本节的模型假设净含量固定。当商品按实际称重计价时，挂牌价的分母仍是基本单位（每千克），但 <code>q_base</code> 在接单时是未知的——它取决于出库称重。这一情形改变了金额锁定与库存扣减的时机，见 <a href=\"catch-weight-variable-weight\">按重量计价/可变重量商品</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>挂牌价是源、单位价与结算价是派生；单位价按需计算并缓存，缓存键必须包含市场规则版本。</li>\n<li>换算口径以基本单位为准：先把挂牌价归一化到每基本单位价，再用基本单位数量相乘，保证任意单位组合只有一条路径。</li>\n<li>取整只在末端一次：数量 half-even、货币 half-up、报关按监管规定。</li>\n<li>单位价格的基准单位由市场法规决定，不能在前端写死；位数与可见性同样受规则约束。</li>\n<li>每日归一化重算是发现&quot;两套因子&quot;最有效的巡检。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>下一篇 <a href=\"catch-weight-variable-weight\">按重量计价/可变重量商品</a> 处理净含量本身不固定的情形。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"每单位/每升/每百克价折算与展示","id":"每单位-每升-每百克价折算与展示"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"单价的三种身份","id":"单价的三种身份"},{"level":3,"text":"挂牌价、单位价、结算价","id":"挂牌价-单位价-结算价"},{"level":3,"text":"为什么不能把单位价存为主数据","id":"为什么不能把单位价存为主数据"},{"level":2,"text":"折算的两种方向","id":"折算的两种方向"},{"level":3,"text":"从单价推总价，还是从总价推单价","id":"从单价推总价-还是从总价推单价"},{"level":3,"text":"取整只在末端","id":"取整只在末端"},{"level":2,"text":"单位价格展示的规则","id":"单位价格展示的规则"},{"level":3,"text":"分母由法规决定","id":"分母由法规决定"},{"level":3,"text":"小数位数与可见性","id":"小数位数与可见性"},{"level":2,"text":"实现要点","id":"实现要点"},{"level":3,"text":"缓存键与失效","id":"缓存键与失效"},{"level":3,"text":"一致性对账","id":"一致性对账"},{"level":2,"text":"与可变重量商品的交界","id":"与可变重量商品的交界"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"起订量/整箱倍数下单约束","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/unit-measure-packsize-conversion/pack-hierarchy/moq-case-multiple-ordering"},"next":{"title":"按重量计价/可变重量(catch-weight)商品","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/unit-measure-packsize-conversion/uom-pricing-inventory/catch-weight-variable-weight"}}